ate $Q(x,y)$ with respect to $y.$  Note that the solution should contain an arbitrary function of $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u(x,y) & =\\int Q(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y+g(x) \\\\  & =\\int (x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)-\\frac{1}{y})\\text{d}y+g(x) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡y+g(x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComparing the two solutions, we see that we must have\n\n$$\ng(x)=-\\operatorname{ln}⁡x,\\,f(y)=-\\operatorname{ln}⁡y.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution $u(x,y)=c$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡y & =c \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy) & =c.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535258 true] [17592186340225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340226 13194139535258 true] [17592186340225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340227 13194139535258 true] [17592186340225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340228 13194139535258 true] [17592186340225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340229 13194139535258 true] [17592186340225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340230 13194139535258 true] [17592186340225 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535258 true] [17592186340225 1041 "selection" 13194139535258 true] [17592186340225 1104 #edb/ref 17592186340228 13194139535258 true] [17592186340225 1110 #uuid "c7ca6fb9-3fc5-51de-8620-5dbf05bb13ae" 13194139535258 true] [17592186340226 1034 "xy\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy)=c" 13194139535258 true] [17592186340226 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535258 true] [17592186340226 1111 #uuid "da460d15-c407-50eb-85bf-be68a009abc4" 13194139535258 true] [17592186340227 1034 "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy)=c" 13194139535258 true] [17592186340227 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535258 true] [17592186340227 1111 #uuid "090c95eb-400e-5640-8e37-35a80ef250e8" 13194139535258 true] [17592186340228 1034 "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy)=c" 13194139535258 true] [17592186340228 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535258 true] [17592186340228 1111 #uuid "e67894ba-728a-5bea-8e2a-