)=5{y}^{4}{e}^{2x}.$ \n\nFirst, let's differentiate $Q(x,y)$ with respect to $x$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}=\\frac{∂}{∂x}(5{y}^{4}{e}^{2x})=10{y}^{4}{e}^{2x}\n$$\n\nNow, let's apply $\\frac{∂}{∂y}$ to each of the given options:\n\n- First, we check $P(x,y)=10{y}^{5}{e}^{x}+4.$ This gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂y}(10{y}^{5}{e}^{x}+4)=50{y}^{4}{e}^{x}\\ne \\frac{∂Q}{∂x}\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x,y)=10{y}^{5}{e}^{x}+4$ does *not* give an exact equation.\n\n- Next, we check $P(x,y)=2{y}^{5}{e}^{2x}-y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2{y}^{5}{e}^{2x}-y)=10{y}^{4}{e}^{2x}-1\\ne \\frac{∂Q}{∂x}\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x,y)=2{y}^{5}{e}^{2x}-y$ does *not* give an exact equation.\n\n- Finally, we check $P(x,y)=2{y}^{5}{e}^{2x}+{e}^{-x}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2{y}^{5}{e}^{2x}+{e}^{-x})=10{y}^{4}{e}^{2x}=\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x,y)=2{y}^{5}{e}^{2x}+{e}^{-x}$ gives an exact equation." 13194139535258 true] [17592186340350 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340351 13194139535258 true] [17592186340350 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340352 13194139535258 true] [17592186340350 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340353 13194139535258 true] [17592186340350 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340354 13194139535258 true] [17592186340350 1000 #edb/ref 17592186340355 13194139535258 true] [17592186340350 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535258 true] [17592186340350 1041 "selection" 13194139535258 true] [17592186340350 1104 #edb/ref 17592186340353 13194139535258 true] [17592186340350 1110 #uuid "a6d64997-7ece-5ca0-b47d-4e64db5be222" 13194139535258 true] [17592186340351 1034 "II and III only" 13194139535258 true] [17592186340351 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535258 true] [17592186340351 1111 #uuid "e6788963-2536-54dd-a248-42342d8e26d3" 13194139535258 true] [17592186340352 1034 "I only" 13194139535258 true] [17592186340352 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535258 true] [17592186340352 1111 #uuid "05f7d98a-ecdf-5517-a50c-7d92e